    "prompts": {
      "prp": "Create an original photorealistic editorial still life for a PRP service website card and detail hero. Landscape 1536x1024, full-frame 3:2 composition. Conservative preparation concept: two sealed empty transparent laboratory collection tubes with plain neutral caps resting neatly in a simple rack beside folded white gauze on warm ivory surface. No blood, no sample liquid or separated layers, no needle, no treatment in progress, no people, no labels/calibration marks/logos/text, no clinic setting or branded equipment. Credible clean cylindrical glass geometry, realistic reflections, soft warm daylight, elegant cream/taupe palette. Objects centrally composed with generous intact margins for full-frame contain display, readable at small card size. This is a conceptual preparation still life, not documentation of a clinic protocol or a treatment result.",
      "microneedling": "Create original photorealistic editorial still-life photograph for Microneedling service card/detail hero, 1536x1024 landscape 3:2. A single restrained unbranded pen-shaped skincare instrument lies diagonally on folded white gauze on warm ivory stone. Tip is fully covered by a smooth opaque protective cap; absolutely no exposed needles/spikes/cartridge fields. Simple credible cylindrical metal body and fully closed smooth cap, no calibration markings, numbers, letters, logo, display, buttons or pseudo-text. No people/hands, blood, skin puncture, active procedure, results, specific clinic equipment or premises. Soft warm daylight, realistic metal reflections and contact shadows, cream/taupe editorial aesthetic. Complete instrument in frame with generous margins; focal subject clear at small card size; no text overlays. Conceptual capped instrument, not a documentary representation of clinic device or procedure."
    },
